  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the scene as the recipient of a threatening metaphor",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the 'barbeque_threat_scene' as the implied recipient of the threat. The text 'do you like to barbeque' directly addresses the user with 'you', and 'cause i'm bout to slap this meat across your grill' uses 'your grill', explicitly directing the threat toward the user's personal domain (their grill). The user is thus projected onto the scene as the target of the misogynistic objectification metaphor.",
